sDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Mati per user; hidupkan: Settings › Features › Web Search\nChat & project chat saja (tak ada di tabular, Word)\nPilihan per jenis model: Claude → Anthropic Search | layanan | Off\nOpenAI → OpenAI Search | layanan | Off · lainnya → layanan | Off\nGemini native sengaja tidak ditawarkan (aturan tampilan saran Google)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Mati per user; hidupkan: Settings › Features › Web Search\nChat & project chat saja (tak ada di tabular, Word)\nPilihan per jenis model: Claude → Anthropic Search | layanan | Off\nOpenAI → OpenAI Search | layanan | Off · lainnya → layanan | Off\nGemini native sengaja tidak ditawarkan (aturan tampilan saran Google)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1e2ffceba5144f1b9cce", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 140, "width": 730, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["d9e9276b38f84c558043"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1562198915, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1149049301, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4c5296714eef4917a2f2", "type": "text", "x": 844, "y": 175.4, "width": 180.5, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["d9e9276b38f84c558043"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2079184250, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 669660269, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cara pencarian jalan", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cara pencarian jalan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "5e56dfc2ae40421fa67d", "type": "text", "x": 844, "y": 207.1, "width": 522.4, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["d9e9276b38f84c558043"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 755851871, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 331635300, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Native provider: provider mencari & membaca halaman, ditagih ke kunci API\n  (≤5 pencarian per request; tool tetap ditawarkan sepanjang jawaban)\nLayanan Mike: Brave | Tavily | DeepSeek dipanggil dari backend (≤8 per jawaban)\n  Tavily/DeepSeek ikut membaca halaman; Brave → Mike membaca sendiri\nKunci layanan per user; tanpa kunci → model itu tidak mencari", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Native provider: provider mencari & membaca halaman, ditagih ke kunci API\n  (≤5 pencarian per request; tool tetap ditawarkan sepanjang jawaban)\nLayanan Mike: Brave | Tavily | DeepSeek dipanggil dari backend (≤8 per jawaban)\n  Tavily/DeepSeek ikut membaca halaman; Brave → Mike membaca sendiri\nKunci layanan per user; tanpa kunci → model itu tidak mencari", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "55a3c4561f624960a9b8", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1600, "y": 140, "width": 730, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4394d6356cac4e02b6ea"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2144280413, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 837245192, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a18d49070b934620b955", "type": "text", "x": 1614, "y": 175.4, "width": 267.5, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4394d6356cac4e02b6ea"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1060910853, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2125233405, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Pembaca halaman (web_read)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Pembaca halaman (web_read)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e9a67e55fb84496786e1", "type": "text", "x": 1614, "y": 207.1, "width": 566.4, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4394d6356cac4e02b6ea"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 673484266, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 50223258, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "lib/webSearch/pageReader.ts: fetch dari server (SSRF dijaga:\n  blockedDestination / privateIp), HTML → teks, batasan ukuran\nDipakai untuk tautan dari user dan hasil yang perlu dibaca penuh\nHasil = KONTEN TAK TEPERCAYA (nonce) · event web_search/web_read/web_sources\nDieksekusi PARALEL di runTools; sumber ikut disitasi", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "lib/webSearch/pageReader.ts: fetch dari server (SSRF dijaga:\n  blockedDestination / privateIp), HTML → teks, batasan ukuran\nDipakai untuk tautan dari user dan hasil yang perlu dibaca penuh\nHasil = KONTEN TAK TEPERCAYA (nonce) · event web_search/web_read/web_sources\nDieksekusi PARALEL di runTools; sumber ikut disitasi", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "8f04893078eb40288a95", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 430, "width": 730, "height": 230, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5259a9623b61472bb341"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 774641045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 782937648, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "f7850b6a32d44449ae45", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 467.9, "width": 199.0, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5259a9623b61472bb341"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1952090281, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 578489847, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CourtListener — akses", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CourtListener — akses", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "659f96e637354369ae98", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 499.6, "width": 525.7, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5259a9623b61472bb341"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1694264112, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 892019798, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Konektor per workspace; token API user disimpan terenkripsi di\nuser_courtlistener_connections (Personal & tiap org terpisah)\nOrg boleh memegang token untuk anggotanya → didahulukan di org itu\nTak ada token global (.env tidak lagi dibaca)\nTool hanya ditawarkan di chat & project chat bila switch workspace ON\nBulk data opsional: COURTLISTENER_BULK_DATA_ENABLED → baca dulu dari\ncourtlistener_citation_index / _opinion_cluster_index (Supabase/R2)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Konektor per workspace; token API user disimpan terenkripsi di\nuser_courtlistener_connections (Personal & tiap org terpisah)\nOrg boleh memegang token untuk anggotanya → didahulukan di org itu\nTak ada token global (.env tidak lagi dibaca)\nTool hanya ditawarkan di chat & project chat bila switch workspace ON\nBulk data opsional: COURTLISTENER_BULK_DATA_ENABLED → baca dulu dari\ncourtlistener_citation_index / _opinion_cluster_index (Supabase/R2)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "a1e7c269e30248599e45", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 430, "width": 730, "height": 230, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["6ac495b6cde84495bb28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1376637919, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 795458756, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ef1a387e54534bb89af8", "type": "text", "x": 844, "y": 485.4, "width": 251.2, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["6ac495b6cde84495bb28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 229575718, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200669871, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176924, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CourtListener — tool & event", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "conta